  "prefLabel": "Tax 210.11 Interest on Excess Award",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Tax 210.11 Interest on Excess Award. If the board's just compensation award exceeds the damage deposit, the condemnor shall pay the condemnee interest on the excess award at the statutory rate calculated from the declaration filing date to the payment date in accordance with RSA 524:1-b and RSA 336:1.\n\nSource. #5638, eff 9-1-93; ss by #6762, eff 7-1-98; ss by #7153, eff 12-10-99; ss by #8987-A, eff 9-24-07; ss by #9538, eff 9-8-09; ss by #10625-B, eff 6-26-14; ss by #13711-B, eff 8-2-23",
